Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:25:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] wine: implement WinRT, WinUI XAML runtime, AppModel, and
 Redhawk interop for UWP Store apps

- combase: add unmanaged ComWrappers isolation, MTA threading, RoGetActivationFactory, and apartment activation
- windows.ui.xaml: implement Application, Frame, Page, Window, DependencyProperty round-trip storage, and native X11 window mapping
- windows.applicationmodel: implement AppInfo, Package, UserActivities (UserActivityRequestManager), ResourceLoader, and MemoryManager
- twinapi.appcore: implement CoreApplication, ApplicationView, and ClientDeviceInformation
- windows.ui: implement CoreDispatcher, CoreWindow, and notifications
- appxdeploymentclient & kernelbase: prefix-seeded package identity registry, ALPC stubs, and package resolution
- threadpoolwinrt & cryptowinrt: thread pool async actions, data protection, and async handlers
- dcomp & dxgi: DirectComposition device, surface compositor, and swap chain interop
- Fix Redhawk FailFast 1007 on IID_ComWrappers_internal and bounds-guard IAsyncAction register dereferences
